      "content": "thanks. i'm trying but it's just hard to see any point to it all. like, i spent two decades building a foundation and now there's nothing left to build on. the math just doesn't add up anymore. it feels like i'm just part of a losing game and i'm the only one still playing. i'm just so tired of trying to fix something that's basically broken beyond repair.",
